        "TileImage": "$($repository 987d8547-6a26-477a-bd62-45ab4f165dd7).Image",
        "Description": "First up, Shuchun Tan. Shuchun is a seemingly innocent person on the island, but is secretly assistint Farah in her control and seizing of the hostages on the island.\r\rFarah is a manipulative woman, a barkeep, keeping the public in her hands. If you were to tell anyone she captured hostages, you&apos;d be called crazy and banished.\r\rLastly, Ravi Kunda. Ravi Kunda is a former ICA agent, working to exfiltrate the hostages, and is giving it a second thought. Eliminate him before he changes his mind.",
